/T (Cyber security is the practice of protecting computers, networks, servers, mobile devices, applications and data from unauthorised access, attacks, damage or theft. In my own words, it is like locking the doors and windows of our digital world: only the right people should be able to enter, the information inside should not be changed by outsiders, and the services should keep working whenever genuine users need them.)
/E (Cyber security is the practice of protecting computers, networks, servers, mobile devices, applications and data from unauthorised access, attacks, damage or theft. In my own words, it is like locking the doors and windows of our digital world: only the right people should be able to enter, the information inside should not be changed by outsiders, and the services should keep working whenever genuine users need them.)
