<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 120 0 R
/T (availability of information, and that threats such as malware, viruses, phishing, spyware and DoS attacks affect real platforms like a college website every day. I also learnt how networks are built from devices like modems, routers and switches, how addresses \(IP and MAC\) and DNS make communication possible, and how a request travels as packets from a browser to a web server and back. Finally, I understood how firewalls, antivirus, VPNs, encryption and authentication work together as layers of defence, and I practised finding and interpreting the IP address of my own system.)
/E (availability of information, and that threats such as malware, viruses, phishing, spyware and DoS attacks affect real platforms like a college website every day. I also learnt how networks are built from devices like modems, routers and switches, how addresses \(IP and MAC\) and DNS make communication possible, and how a request travels as packets from a browser to a web server and back. Finally, I understood how firewalls, antivirus, VPNs, encryption and authentication work together as layers of defence, and I practised finding and interpreting the IP address of my own system.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [5]
>>
